K3V GBA provenance and third-party notices
==========================================

K3V GBA is a renamed and substantially repaired distribution of an open-source
Analogue Pocket port of the MiSTer Game Boy Advance FPGA core.

Source lineage retained for copyright and license compliance:

- GBA_MiSTer contributors:
  https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/GBA_MiSTer
- Pocket-port import:
  https://github.com/mincer-ray/openfpga-GBA
  tag v0.6.2, commit b08568fa60ff6f5f918cca5763f5b1923ed2d3db
- K3V GBA RTC, save-path, PSRAM, validation, packaging, artwork, and build
  changes begin with release v0.1.0.

Additional incorporated work includes Analogue's openFPGA framework, Intel/
Altera generated IP, analogue-pocket-utils-derived integration patterns,
OpenGateware audio/filter components, and other contributors identified in
individual source headers.

Names and project links in this notice are used only to preserve provenance and
license compliance. They do not imply endorsement of K3V GBA.
